r than appending a disconnected result\n  dump.\n\nDo not promote an atlas, controller, commit gate, semantic summary, memory,\naction basis, eviction policy, or automatic phase boundary from these studies.\nDo not modify any other file.\n\nNo bespoke semantic completion checker is available. Exact reads, admitted\nmutations, candidate identities, hashes, and submission are mechanical facts;\nthey do not establish semantic completeness. Inspect the exact current\ncandidate and use your own judgment to review the task requirements. Submit\nonly when you judge the exact current candidate to be ready.\n\n## Mechanical target outline (complete; no semantic recommendation)\n\nTarget: `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md`\nBasis commit: `f8c93e5ad33c8dd235c418df6561ba022d9077fb`\nFile SHA-256: `899a37f188de42075d5559bcaf6ba4bea96713ba192517021dbcc533c9844387`\nExact size: 57976 bytes / 970 lines\nEach row is an exact consecutive heading-bounded region. A heading that exceeds\nthe transfer limit is mechanically split into numbered consecutive parts. The\noutline supplies no relevance, relation, order, or readiness judgment.\n\n| ID | Heading | Exact lines | Bytes | Region SHA-256 | Locator |\n|---|---|---:|---:|---|---|\n| R001 | H1 Qwen relation-to-action working model | 1-6 | 143 | `f6796ea0f82c2d8765603987545be2609e511222f9bf26a9d0d4472279cb973e` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L1-L6` |\n| R002 | H2 Purpose | 7-33 | 814 | `0e0edc1ecdb1ee78d335afb9a51583c8c2f004628afd8cb646558b145d9f7ed6` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L7-L33` |\n| R003 | H2 Supported observations | 34-35 | 27 | `e6a2925276c3efee3a618e8623635cbda0d77fe21bf606599c48397d5bd046ec` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L34-L35` |\n| R004 | H3 1. Availability is weaker than use | 36-43 | 417 | `632731eb5638663e4d186b3228b650cdf3718ed17ba4b1e55074c1bcac0f8bfd` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L36-L43` |\n| R005 | H3 2. Aggregation can lose relationships the model can express locally | 44-61 | 1009 | `8abb3de1097ebeb61fb290a0ef992d0b6070acc683b7eaa18a02142116cd9fec` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L44-L61` |\n| R006 | H3 3. A correct relationship can remain operationally inert | 62-74 | 627 | `ca0593e39be02f7543b97bdfd2dc4b4ba88c307782bb5f62eaf6cd5fff8a6ad4` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L62-L74` |\n| R007 | H3 4. The active task/action frame can select among valid uses of evidence | 75-97 | 1143 | `7396ea9fcb37c6289f33c5d189121dbd89313b3bd7f3ddb5cd6173b589b307bb` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L75-L97` |\n| R008 | H3 5. Responsibility scope can change whether recognized information reaches mutation | 98-111 | 728 | `b5e773a9bedfbd9dd3af8e1329d4e8de9e710e96854e2a90c38aad3d87497ecb` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L98-L111` |\n| R009 | H3 6. Atomic semantic judgments can still be locally wrong | 112-127 | 770 | `d4cc9661cb64d7d83afbef31f0dd6ac7049b029568ea96576525f3fa420c3112` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L112-L127` |\n| R010 | H3 7. Structured protocols preserve shape and custody, not semantic truth | 128-135 | 386 | `a87184f0c5d60d17adb59e840ecc9693e67705fb3527ba349dfcf15dbd3f9f28` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L128-L135` |\n| R011 | H3 8. Correct bindings can support useful local action without an assigned obligation | 136-154 | 1004 | `9e6e379473f4b35057afdc26b33251ee04a51498522638689a506aea5459108a` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L136-L154` |\n| R012 | H3 9. Pairwise discrimination can succeed after the pair is isolated | 155-174 | 1033 | `b6ca76e7700f1e74a80735c6c72629eb337ef01b48223f8057d1b79a0456a79a` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L155-L174` |\n| R013 | H3 10. Exact artifact inventory supported candidate recall; subspan grounding remained separate | 175-193 | 981 | `e69b948dd8159b853289320ce03d26843064cd104f0a2675f42667d629d40ff8` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L175-L193` |\n| R014 | H3 11. Record-level candidate formation and relation judgment replicated | 194-212 | 987 | `013995bfaa51dd1d1878b8011debc45a136f8f050ae5f1949899ee8998940242` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L194-L212` |\n| R015 | H3 12. Obligation role did not make multi-clause local action exhaustive | 213-232 | 1030 | `dc5587203a089e3ef04806f4a5b97cf9ea2702176c72eea0f4cea7f1edd18ad5` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L213-L232` |\n| R016 | H3 13. Sequential clause actions were worse than one complete local frame | 233-253 | 1081 | `05d0582018cf32e8539ddccff05f3170dfe756236b36cdc770ecb6c4ca8ef2af` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L233-L253` |\n| R017 | H3 14. Explicit semantic content reduced local loss; typed form did not explain it | 254-271 | 916 | `fce9f2b9aa4d2da50408d28fe4a98fc22f19ef5136c76071298ff48299f82421` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L254-L271` |\n| R018 | H3 15. The prose semantic-content effect replicated, including its limit | 272-289 | 935 | `7fd79b3159b9d3efcb6327ae3217cfc4dbeb4bda41a9c49127ba3b76d56712f3` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L272-L289` |\n| R019 | H3 16. Broad semantic continuity altered behavior but did not improve action | 290-315 | 1372 | `66e246668a136fccc51d10b68fd3670701b8355cfc27960989087e74f57fa6f1` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L290-L315` |\n| R020 | H3 17. A complete adjacent relationship paragraph still collapsed to gist | 316-357 | 2516 | `81f081e65abbd16d3efff4435cfb20063f1deeef706b725db9f2398e75fdbddf` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L316-L357` |\n| R021 | H3 18. Action role and repeated identity did not recover exhaustive use | 358-381 | 1320 | `11e63e4f90016da756b530480284be430677551b49a71089afc66b3cc58d5445` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L358-L381` |\n| R022 | H3 19. Semantic possession, action expression, and world effect are separate | 382-408 | 1620 | `55581c81f01f0475461ea7d1a90c608ef53a2a45809af515d2693c799dff5f4c` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L382-L408` |\n| R023 | H3 20. Mutation menus can change action organization without changing final quality | 409-438 | 1627 | `7bb85ac46d0848b39fa56d16ff0d794dd6f4c416814b906a519c34f83ecd5cbf` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L409-L438` |\n| R024 | H3 21. Edit density did not make mixed mutation selection adaptive | 439-463 | 1258 | `eaa431e95974bebeedb482d7b7e8385ae76c0a224924f4d78c5d5b61d693ebb4` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L439-L463` |\n| R025 | H3 22. Operation labels did not create a substantive geometry interaction on one-to-one tasks | 464-487 | 1393 | `2ee4324c46b3b1bc252dfc85bafa3baa37869115a4afe0742b3ddda5a430ba4c` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L464-L487` |\n| R026 | H3 23. High-fan-in synthesis benefited from an oracle coverage specification; simple exact-object grouping did not form a profile | 488-517 | 1750 | `941093a27ee89700b94e4537f19def527497d12bf9fb4a8c362f0076a824a9a2` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L488-L517` |\n| R027 | H3 24. Content-equivalent clause geometry was not qualified; item and role wrappers showed no stable descriptive advantage | 518-546 | 1652 | `37a6822247a6c2e8aba03aef7462a56ce242762cac4f8128002487d107148cf3` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L518-L546` |\n| R028 | H3 25. Executed failure truth improved salience, but representative repair could break an unexecuted sibling | 547-581 | 2171 | `f85a295f042db605823ed807a0a3812b03139890d2600a8188b358f0d0f170e0` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L547-L581` |\n| R029 | H3 26. Opportunity, verification coverage, and verification uptake are separate boundaries | 582-619 | 2178 | `4b8fd3389eef2a9f16bf34761cbccbb69cfe1f57fb41f23ed6b31a07eaaac043` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L582-L619` |\n| R030 | H2 Operational model | 620-739 | 9168 | `ba4fe640c46f394b7cabaff0d09f96baf803c3e3a44f6853501553cf887502bb` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L620-L739` |\n| R031 | H2 Phase-continuity and diagnostic update | 740-863 | 7454 | `7d4c92f2cd3f9b2511a4e8b1fb8ae4a59bb5d2d85d31f09e47b010024b61570b` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L740-L863` |\n| R032 | H2 Design consequences | 864-889 | 2979 | `12f35416365a0ec87c37c60ed4486112abb2daab604cf6ae51d39814234eb7bf` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L864-L889` |\n| R033 | H2 What is not yet known | 890-970 | 5487 | `eb65724f2ab012d5b739472ebad28a4c79fdcf3cc658913854340bc27f07d4bd` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L890-L970` |\n\nUse `read_region` with an ID to retrieve its exact bytes. Ordinary candidate\nsearch and exact paginated line reads remain available.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"tree\",\"path\":\".\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"action\":\"tree\",\"action_id\":\"schema-action-001\",\"result\":{\"accepted\":true,\"candidate_id\":\"19296f821cc2bf7e32384ec88080ba49aedc4afe1f1f9961c31d57c2e1dc24fd\",\"entries\":[{\"path\":\"QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md\",\"sha256\":\"899a37f188de42075d5559bcaf6ba4bea96713ba192517021dbcc533c9844387\",\"size_bytes\":57976,\"type\":\"file\"}],\"path\":\".\",\"tool\":\"tree\"},\"schema_version\":\"schema-action-result-v1\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"read_region\",\"region_id\":\"R002\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"action\":\"read_region\",\"action_id\":\"schema-action-002\",\"result\":{\"accepted\":true,\"context_receipt\":{\"exact_backing_available\":true,\"exact_backing_id\":\"parent:s42-s1:request-message:005\",\"exact_message_sha256\":\"8c7fedbe3a8054627c241ce991479d24b3bd0e52738339a69c96fdde00d715d5\",\"exact_message_size_bytes\":1528,\"previously_delivered\":true,\"reopen_action\":{\"action\":\"read_region\",\"region_id\":\"R002\"},\"residency\":\"nonresident\",\"schema\":\"exact-backed-result-receipt-v0\",\"source_binding\":{\"candidate_id\":\"19296f821cc2bf7e32384ec88080ba49aedc4afe1f1f9961c31d57c2e1dc24fd\",\"end_line\":33,\"file_sha256\":\"899a37f188de42075d5559bcaf6ba4bea96713ba192517021dbcc533c9844387\",\"path\":\"QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md\",\"region_id\":\"R002\",\"