ge action organization without changing final quality | 409-438 | 1627 | `7bb85ac46d0848b39fa56d16ff0d794dd6f4c416814b906a519c34f83ecd5cbf` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L409-L438` |\n| R024 | H3 21. Edit density did not make mixed mutation selection adaptive | 439-463 | 1258 | `eaa431e95974bebeedb482d7b7e8385ae76c0a224924f4d78c5d5b61d693ebb4` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L439-L463` |\n| R025 | H3 22. Operation labels did not create a substantive geometry interaction on one-to-one tasks | 464-487 | 1393 | `2ee4324c46b3b1bc252dfc85bafa3baa37869115a4afe0742b3ddda5a430ba4c` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L464-L487` |\n| R026 | H3 23. High-fan-in synthesis benefited from an oracle coverage specification; simple exact-object grouping did not form a profile | 488-517 | 1750 | `941093a27ee89700b94e4537f19def527497d12bf9fb4a8c362f0076a824a9a2` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L488-L517` |\n| R027 | H3 24. Content-equivalent clause geometry was not qualified; item and role wrappers showed no stable descriptive advantage | 518-546 | 1652 | `37a6822247a6c2e8aba03aef7462a56ce242762cac4f8128002487d107148cf3` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L518-L546` |\n| R028 | H3 25. Executed failure truth improved salience, but representative repair could break an unexecuted sibling | 547-581 | 2171 | `f85a295f042db605823ed807a0a3812b03139890d2600a8188b358f0d0f170e0` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L547-L581` |\n| R029 | H3 26. Opportunity, verification coverage, and verification uptake are separate boundaries | 582-619 | 2178 | `4b8fd3389eef2a9f16bf34761cbccbb69cfe1f57fb41f23ed6b31a07eaaac043` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L582-L619` |\n| R030 | H2 Operational model | 620-739 | 9168 | `ba4fe640c46f394b7cabaff0d09f96baf803c3e3a44f6853501553cf887502bb` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L620-L739` |\n| R031 | H2 Phase-continuity and diagnostic update | 740-863 | 7454 | `7d4c92f2cd3f9b2511a4e8b1fb8ae4a59bb5d2d85d31f09e4