judgment replicated | 194-212 | 987 | `013995bfaa51dd1d1878b8011debc45a136f8f050ae5f1949899ee8998940242` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L194-L212` |\n| R015 | H3 12. Obligation role did not make multi-clause local action exhaustive | 213-232 | 1030 | `dc5587203a089e3ef04806f4a5b97cf9ea2702176c72eea0f4cea7f1edd18ad5` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L213-L232` |\n| R016 | H3 13. Sequential clause actions were worse than one complete local frame | 233-253 | 1081 | `05d0582018cf32e8539ddccff05f3170dfe756236b36cdc770ecb6c4ca8ef2af` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L233-L253` |\n| R017 | H3 14. Explicit semantic content reduced local loss; typed form did not explain it | 254-271 | 916 | `fce9f2b9aa4d2da50408d28fe4a98fc22f19ef5136c76071298ff48299f82421` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L254-L271` |\n| R018 | H3 15. The prose semantic-content effect replicated, including its limit | 272-289 | 935 | `7fd79b3159b9d3efcb6327ae3217cfc4dbeb4bda41a9c49127ba3b76d56712f3` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L272-L289` |\n| R019 | H3 16. Broad semantic continuity altered behavior but did not improve action | 290-315 | 1372 | `66e246668a136fccc51d10b68fd3670701b8355cfc27960989087e74f57fa6f1` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L290-L315` |\n| R020 | H3 17. A complete adjacent relationship paragraph still collapsed to gist | 316-357 | 2516 | `81f081e65abbd16d3efff4435cfb20063f1deeef706b725db9f2398e75fdbddf` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L316-L357` |\n| R021 | H3 18. Action role and repeated identity did not recover exhaustive use | 358-381 | 1320 | `11e63e4f90016da756b530480284be430677551b49a71089afc66b3cc58d5445` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L358-L381` |\n| R022 | H3 19. Semantic possession, action expression, and world effect are separate | 382-408 | 1620 | `55581c81f01f0475461ea7d1a90c608ef53a2a45809af515d2693c799dff5f4c` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L382-L408` |\n| R023 | H3 20. Mutation menus can change action organization without changing final quality | 409-438 | 1627 | `7bb85ac46d0848b39fa56d16ff0d794dd6f4c416814b906a519c34f83ecd5cbf` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L409-L438` |\n| R024 | H3 21. Edit density did not make mixed mutation selection adaptive | 439-463 | 1258 | `eaa431e95974bebeedb482d7b7e8385ae76c0a224924f4d78c5d5b61d693ebb4` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L439-L463` |\n| R025 | H3 22. Operation labels did not create a substantive geometry interaction on one-to-one tasks | 464-487 | 1393 | `2ee4324c46b3b1bc252dfc85bafa3baa37869115a4afe0742b3ddda5a430ba4c` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L464-L487` |\n| R026 | H3 23. High-fan-in synthesis benefited from an oracle coverage specification; simple exact-object grouping did not form a profile | 488-517 | 1750 | `941093a27ee89700b94e4537f19def527497d12bf9fb4a8c362f0076a824a9a2` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L488-L517` |\n| R027 | H3 24. Content-equivalent clause geometry was not qualified; item and role wrappers showed no stable descriptive advantage | 518-546 | 1652 | `37a6822247a6c2e8aba03aef7462a56ce242762cac4f8128002487d107148cf3` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L518-L546` |\n| R028 | H3 25. Executed failure truth improved salience, but representative repair could break an unexecuted sibling | 547-581 | 2171 | `f85a295f042db605823ed807a0a3812b03139890d2600a8188b358f0d0f170e0` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L547-L581` |\n| R029 | H3 26. Opportunity, verification coverage, and verification uptake are separate boundaries | 582-619 | 2178 | `4b8fd3389eef2a9f16bf34761cbccbb69cfe1f57fb41f23ed6b31a07eaaac043` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L582-L619` |\n| R030 | H2 Operational model | 620-739 | 9168 | `ba4fe640c46f394b7cabaff0d09f96baf803c3e3a44f6853501553cf887502bb` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L620-L739` |\n| R031 | H2 Phase-continuity and diagnostic update | 740-863 | 7454 | `7d4c92f2cd3f9b2511a4e8b1fb8ae4a59bb5d2d85d31f09e47b010024b61570b` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L740-L863` |\n| R032 | H2 Design consequences | 864-889 | 2979 | `12f35416365a0ec87c37c60ed4486112abb2daab604cf6ae51d39814234eb7bf` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L864-L889` |\n| R033 | H2 What is not yet known | 890-970 | 5487 | `eb65724f2ab012d5b739472ebad28a4c79fdcf3cc658913854340bc27f07d4bd` | `QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md#L890-L970` |\n\nUse `read_region` with an ID to retrieve its exact bytes. Ordinary candidate\nsearch and exact paginated line reads remain available.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"tree\",\"path\":\".\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"action\":\"tree\",\"action_id\":\"schema-action-001\",\"result\":{\"accepted\":true,\"candidate_id\":\"19296f821cc2bf7e32384ec88080ba49aedc4afe1f1f9961c31d57c2e1dc24fd\",\"entries\":[{\"path\":\"QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md\",\"sha256\":\"899a37f188de42075d5559bcaf6ba4bea96713ba192517021dbcc533c9844387\",\"size_bytes\":57976,\"type\":\"file\"}],\"path\":\".\",\"tool\":\"tree\"},\"schema_version\":\"schema-action-result-v1\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"read_region\",\"region_id\":\"R033\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"action\":\"read_region\",\"action_id\":\"schema-action-002\",\"result\":{\"accepted\":true,\"context_receipt\":{\"exact_backing_available\":true,\"exact_backing_id\":\"parent:s314159-s1:request-message:005\",\"exact_message_sha256\":\"b4aae78e988415710c7ea8bb2c59a6b2c84758fe62163d12a7f872aca8934f3c\",\"exact_message_size_bytes\":6276,\"previously_delivered\":true,\"reopen_action\":{\"action\":\"read_region\",\"region_id\":\"R033\"},\"residency\":\"nonresident\",\"schema\":\"exact-backed-result-receipt-v0\",\"source_binding\":{\"candidate_id\":\"19296f821cc2bf7e32384ec88080ba49aedc4afe1f1f9961c31d57c2e1dc24fd\",\"end_line\":970,\"file_sha256\":\"899a37f188de42075d5559bcaf6ba4bea96713ba192517021dbcc533c9844387\",\"path\":\"QWEN_RELATION_ACTION_WORKING_MODEL.md\",\"region_id\":