ursor; it does not automatically fetch the next page. A single line larger than the limit is rejected explicitly.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"end_line\":{\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"path\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_line\":{\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"start_line\",\"end_line\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"continue_lines\",\"description\":\"Continue one previously truncated read_lines or repo_read_lines request from its exact next line. The version-bound cursor is tied to path, requested end, transfer limit, and candidate/file or commit/blob version. Stale or altered cursors are rejected. Calling this remains model-directed; no page is fetched automatically.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"cursor\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"cursor\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"repo_search\",\"description\":\"Find literal text in tracked UTF-8 project sources at the pinned commit. Saved run trees and content-addressed artifacts are excluded from this search index. Returns mechanically bounded exact match windows with path, line, and character coordinates; use repo_read_lines for more context.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"path_prefix\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"query\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"query\",\"path_prefix\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"repo_read\",\"description\":\"Read one exact tracked UTF-8 repository blob at the pinned source commit. Returns its path, commit, blob SHA, size, and complete content. Files over 12,000 bytes are rejected; use repo_read_lines.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"repo_history\",\"description\":\"Return up to ten exact Git commit records touchi